    "text": "## sub_554790_00554790 — BitfieldPropertyUpdater\n\n**Summary:** Compares a2 bitmask against current state this[1117], builds change list of property IDs and values for each changed bit, dispatches all changes to device object via vtable+200. Handles resolution/format mode flags with sub-field updates.\n\n**Frame-path:** NOT_FOUND  \n**Call frequency:** UNKNOWN (no static path from tick root)\n\n**Called by:** AudioBufferFormatSetup (00541120), sub_5550E0 (005550e0), sub_55C070 (0055c070), sub_55C860 (0055c860), sub_55CF50 (0055cf50)\n\n**Struct fields accessed:**\n\n| Base | Offset | R/W | Init (literal → value) | Purpose |\n|------|--------|-----|------------------------|---------|\n| *(this+0x1100) | 0xC8 | R | — | Property setter via vtable+200 on device object |\n| this | 0x0 | RW | — | Result accumulator (set from each dispatch) |\n| this | 0x1100 | R | — | Pointer to device object (this[1088]) |\n| this | 0x1174 | RW | — | Current flags bitmask (this[1117]), updated at end |\n| this | 0x13A4 | R | — | Current resolution value (this[1263]) |\n| this | 0x13BC | RW | 131074 | Word at this+2526 — low word of resolution params |\n| this | 0x13BE | R | — | Word at this+2527 — high word of resolution params |\n| this | 0x13C0 | RW | — | Current a4 value (this[1264]) for property 24 |\n\n**Written-by note (persistence):**\n- this 0x0: Updated from each dispatch return; external poke survives\n- this 0x1174: Overwritten each call with new a2; external poke survives\n- this 0x13BC: Written conditionally; external poke survives\n- this 0x13C0: Written when a4 changes and bit 0x1 set; external poke survives\n\n**Globals referenced:**\n\n| Address | Name | R/W | Role |\n|---------|------|-----|------|\n\n**Functions called:**\n\n| Address | Name | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n\n**Guard conditions (deterministic — field vs literal):**\n\n| Base | Offset | Test | Value | Field / meaning |\n|------|--------|------|-------|-----------------|\n| this |